Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:08:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] tests/sim/tso: litmus and protocol tests for store
 buffering

- litmus: SB (with relaxed / acquire / seq_cst loads, seq_cst fences,
  seq_cst stores, RMW), MP, LB, IRIW, CoRR, CoWR / CoWW, 2+2W,
- Dekker-style wake-up protocol with and without seq_cst fences under
  Random, PCT and DFS schedulers,
- RMW drains the store buffer, store-to-load forwarding,
- termination of busy-wait loops under DFS,
- Twist mutex under store buffering,
- replay of flush decisions.

